# smoke.test -- runs the Explorer smoke suite from the repository test run.
#
# The suite itself lives in apps/explorer/tests/smoke.test. Up to ctrlutils 0.1
# this file was a second, hand-synchronised COPY of it; the two had already
# drifted (an older copy here pointed at a nonexistent ctrlutils/explorer.tcl
# and skipped 17 of 58 tests unnoticed). Now there is one file, sourced here,
# so tests/all.tcl still picks it up. [info script] inside the sourced file
# names that file, so its own path logic works unchanged.
source [file join [file dirname [file normalize [info script]]] \
    .. apps explorer tests smoke.test]
